OL,4,CCritical incident stood down at        
OL,5,Chospital trust                         
OL,6,GA critical incident declared at an NHS 
OL,7,Ghospital trust in Derby has been stood 
OL,8,Gdown.                                  
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and      
OL,11,FBurton (UHDB) NHS Foundation Trust     
OL,12,Fannounced the critical incident on     
OL,13,FTuesday after seasonal respiratory     
OL,14,Fillness, including flu and Covid-19,   
OL,15,Fadded to pressures on its services.    
OL,17,FUHDB, which runs Royal Derby Hospital  
OL,18,Fand Queen's Hospital Burton, said on   
OL,19,FThursday it had "improved              
OL,20,Fsignificantly with faster ambulance    
OL,21,Fhandovers, discharge and overall       
OL,22,Fpatient flow".                    G1/4 
