OL,4,CMan jailed for drugging then abusing   
OL,5,Cgirlfriend                             
OL,6,GA "depraved" offender who repeatedly   
OL,7,Gfilmed himself sexually abusing his    
OL,8,Gunconscious partner after giving her   
OL,9,Gsleeping tablets has been jailed.      
OL,11,FThe man, in his 30s, who the BBC is    
OL,12,Fnot naming in order to protect the     
OL,13,Fidentity of his victim, had been       
OL,14,Fgiving his partner sleeping pills in   
OL,15,Forder to assault her over the course   
OL,16,Fof 13 months, abuse which on a number  
OL,17,Fof occasions he filmed and shared      
OL,18,Fonline.                                
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
