OL,4,CCity anti-social behaviour order set   
OL,5,Cto be expanded                         
OL,6,GPowers to tackle anti-social behaviour 
OL,7,Gin Leicester city centre are set to be 
OL,8,Gexpanded into nearby residential areas 
OL,9,Gfollowing complaints the issue has     
OL,10,Gmade life more "unsafe and less        
OL,11,Genjoyable".                            
OL,13,FThe authority introduced a PSPO in the 
OL,14,Fcity centre in April 2025, which gave  
OL,15,Fwardens the power to issue #100 fines  
OL,16,Ffor behaviour including aggressive     
OL,17,Fbegging, street drinking and dangerous 
OL,18,Friding of electric bikes and scooters. 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
